{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["Come, let us build ourselves a city — by the plain sense, what was the sin of the Generation of the Dispersion? If it was because they said ״וראשו בשמים״, behold it is written (Deuteronomy 1:28): ״ערים גדולות ובצורות בשמים״. Rather, because the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded them (Genesis 1:28): ״פרו ורבו ומלאו את הארץ״, and they chose for themselves a place to settle there, and said ״פן נפוץ״ — therefore He dispersed them from there by His decree."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:19.761774853Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}